// endpoint_inspect_chess_board_square.proto — InspectChessBoardSquare: a
// reader clicked a piece on a feed chess board, and the widget wants what the
// engine says about that square. FEED section.
//
// The widget reports the click and holds nothing else about it; its host — the
// webapp — asks the daemon here, and the daemon asks the board's cee-webapp
